<title>USA: North American Resorts says to be bought.</title>
<headline>North American Resorts says to be bought.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>North American Resorts Inc said it has entered into an agreement to be acquired St. Anthony Entertainment Inc for a combination of stock and royalites equalling $0.15 per share, or approximately $8 million.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to St. Anthony completing its move to become a publicly-reporting company within 90 days and is subject to share holder approval of both companies, it said.</p>
